{
  "schema": "web-ui-page/1",
  "title": "markdown 利用ガイド",
  "theme": "auto",
  "description": "標準ライブラリだけで動く Markdown ユーティリティ（読み書き・目次・HTML↔Markdown）。",
  "icon": "./icon.png",
  "favicon": "./favicon.png",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "badges",
      "items": [
        "📄 単一ファイル",
        "🧰 標準ライブラリのみ",
        "🐍 Python 3.11+"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "📥 取得",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1 ファイルを置くだけで動きます（pip 不要）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "output",
          "text": "curl -fsSLO https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myon-bioinformatics/markdown/main/markdown.py"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "▶️ 実行",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "📑 目次",
          "text": "見出しから目次を作ります。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python markdown.py toc README.md\n- [markdown](#markdown)\n  - [GitHub About（推奨）](#github-about推奨)\n  - [Purpose](#purpose)\n  - [Layout](#layout)\n  - [Optional Gradio-only nano environment](#optional-gradio-only-nano-environment)\n…"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🔁 Markdown → HTML",
          "text": "ファイルの代わりに - で標準入力を読みます。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ echo '# hi' | python markdown.py to-html -\n<h1>hi</h1>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🔎 構成の一覧",
          "text": "見出し・リンクなどを JSON で出します。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python markdown.py inventory README.md\n{\n  \"headings\": [\n    {\n      \"level\": 1,\n      \"title\": \"markdown\"\n    },\n    {\n…"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "↩️ HTML → Markdown",
          "text": "HTML を Markdown に戻します。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ echo '<h1>hi</h1><p>text</p>' | python markdown.py to-markdown -\n# hi\n\ntext"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "🐍 Python から呼ぶ",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "output",
          "text": "$ python -c 'import markdown; print(markdown.markdown_to_html(\"# hi\"))'\n<h1>hi</h1>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "🔗 リンク",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "links",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": "📦 リポジトリ",
              "href": "https://github.com/myon-bioinformatics/markdown"
            },
            {
              "label": "📖 README",
              "href": "https://github.com/myon-bioinformatics/markdown#readme"
            },
            {
              "label": "📄 markdown.py",
              "href": "https://github.com/myon-bioinformatics/markdown/blob/main/markdown.py"
            },
            {
              "label": "🧪 変換レポート",
              "href": "./index.html"
            },
            {
              "label": "🩺 診断",
              "href": "./repository-diagnostics.html"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
